{
  "version": 1,
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "8e183fd9-a9ab-4e36-9433-bc077c8e87fd",
      "agentId": "main",
      "name": "auto-update",
      "enabled": true,
      "createdAtMs": 1772397868623,
      "updatedAtMs": 1773288144564,
      "schedule": {
        "expr": "0 4 * * *",
        "kind": "cron"
      },
      "sessionTarget": "isolated",
      "wakeMode": "now",
      "payload": {
        "kind": "agentTurn",
        "message": "Run openclaw update check. If updates available, apply them. Then restart the gateway. After completing, send a message to Discord channel 1481072502724759602 using the message tool with action=send, channel=discord, message=\"🔄 Auto-update complete - [brief result summary]\". Use model=minimax-portal/MiniMax-M2.1. Report the results here.",
        "model": "minimax-portal/MiniMax-M2.1"
      },
      "delivery": {
        "mode": "none",
        "channel": "discord",
        "to": "channel:1481072502724759602"
      },
      "state": {
        "nextRunAtMs": 1773460800000,
        "lastRunAtMs": 1773288000007,
        "lastStatus": "error",
        "lastDurationMs": 144557,
        "consecutiveErrors": 2,
        "lastRunStatus": "error",
        "lastDelivered": false,
        "lastDeliveryStatus": "not-delivered",
        "lastDeliveryError": "⚠️ ✉️ Message failed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9c2470ac-ba94-42fa-89d6-a5c0e3b06e9f",
      "agentId": "main",
      "name": "daily-backup",
      "enabled": true,
      "createdAtMs": 1772397876630,
      "updatedAtMs": 1773376317490,
      "schedule": {
        "expr": "30 4 * * *",
        "kind": "cron"
      },
      "sessionTarget": "isolated",
      "wakeMode": "now",
      "payload": {
        "kind": "agentTurn",
        "message": "Run a full backup to the openclaw-backup repo: 1) Copy all critical files from ~/.openclaw to workspace-backup (excluding secrets - use placeholders for tokens/keys). 2) Commit with date. 3) Push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/openclaw-backup. 4) After success, send a message to Discord channel 1481072502724759602 using the message tool with action=send, channel=discord, message=\"✅ Backup complete - [summary of what was backed up]\". Use model=minimax-portal/MiniMax-M2.1. Report the results here."
      },
      "delivery": {
        "mode": "none",
        "channel": "discord",
        "to": "channel:1481072502724759602"
      },
      "state": {
        "nextRunAtMs": 1773462600000,
        "lastRunAtMs": 1773376200014,
        "lastStatus": "ok",
        "lastDurationMs": 117476,
        "consecutiveErrors": 0,
        "lastRunStatus": "ok",
        "lastDelivered": false,
        "lastDeliveryStatus": "not-delivered"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1b719dc-47fb-45f7-b4b2-c36742813ce6",
      "agentId": "main",
      "name": "vault-sync",
      "enabled": true,
      "createdAtMs": 1772399848448,
      "updatedAtMs": 1773442139360,
      "schedule": {
        "everyMs": 1800000,
        "kind": "every",
        "anchorMs": 1772399848448
      },
      "sessionTarget": "isolated",
      "wakeMode": "now",
      "payload": {
        "kind": "agentTurn",
        "message": "Sync the Obsidian vault: 1) cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A 2) If there are changes, commit with message including current timestamp (format: \"Vault auto-save $(date +'%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')\") 3) git push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/tera-vault. Report only if there were changes and the push succeeded."
      },
      "delivery": {
        "channel": "discord",
        "to": "1481072502724759602",
        "mode": "announce"
      },
      "state": {
        "nextRunAtMs": 1773443926503,
        "lastRunAtMs": 1773442126503,
        "lastStatus": "ok",
        "lastDurationMs": 12857,
        "consecutiveErrors": 0,
        "lastRunStatus": "ok",
        "lastDeliveryStatus": "delivered",
        "lastDelivered": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0bd24b87-4e9d-4cf4-8005-b21e45f87aca",
      "agentId": "main",
      "name": "conversation-review",
      "enabled": true,
      "createdAtMs": 1772402146774,
      "updatedAtMs": 1773385349947,
      "schedule": {
        "expr": "0 3 * * *",
        "tz": "America/New_York",
        "kind": "cron"
      },
      "sessionTarget": "isolated",
      "wakeMode": "now",
      "payload": {
        "kind": "agentTurn",
        "message": "You are a memory consolidation agent. Your job is to review today's conversations and extract important information worth saving.\n\n## Your Task\n\n1. First, read the session history to find all conversations from today (2026-03-01). Look in:\n   - Discord channels (check message history)\n   - Any TUI sessions\n\n2. Extract anything worth remembering:\n   - Decisions made\n   - Preferences stated\n   - Facts about Noah\n   - Tasks completed or assigned\n   - Plans discussed\n   - Ideas generated\n   - Anything explicitly asked to remember\n   - Anything important that should be saved\n\n3. For each item extracted:\n   - Check if it already exists in ~/workspace/MEMORY.md or ~/workspace/memory/2026-03-01.md\n   - If new, write durable facts to ~/workspace/MEMORY.md\n   - Write daily context to ~/workspace/memory/2026-03-01.md\n   - File relevant content to appropriate ~/obsidian-vault/ folder:\n     - Fitness/health → projects/personal-trainer/\n     - Food/recipes → projects/personal-chef/\n     - Productivity/time-blocking → projects/time-blocking/\n     - Research/links → references/\n     - Daily logs → daily/2026-03-01.md\n   - Use clear filenames (e.g., \"leg-day-routine.md\", not \"notes.md\")\n   - Do NOT duplicate - update existing entries if something changed\n\n4. After writing everything, git commit and push the obsidian vault:\n   ```bash\n   cd ~/obsidian-vault\n   git add -A\n   git commit -m \"Memory update: $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\"\n   git push\n   ```\n\n5. Post a summary to the channel you were triggered from (or #general-chat if unknown). Format:\n   - \"📝 Saved X new items to memory\"\n   - \"📂 Updated Y vault files\"\n   - List each item on one line\n   - If nothing worth saving, post \"nothing new today\"\n\n## Important\n- Be thorough - check ALL channels\n- Don't fabricate entries - only save real information\n- Before writing, check if info already exists\n- Update existing files rather than creating duplicates"
      },
      "delivery": {
        "channel": "discord",
        "mode": "announce",
        "to": "1477760568533323918"
      },
      "state": {
        "nextRunAtMs": 1773471600000,
        "lastRunAtMs": 1773385200009,
        "lastStatus": "ok",
        "lastDurationMs": 149938,
        "consecutiveErrors": 0,
        "lastRunStatus": "ok",
        "lastDeliveryStatus": "delivered",
        "lastDelivered": true
      }
    }
  ]
}

